# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# fukuii-brand — .gitignore
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. Everything not ignored here is world-readable the
# moment it is pushed. Never remove the SECURITY blocks.
#
# This repo has no build system and no package manager, so there is no
# build-output section — nothing here compiles or installs anything. Add the
# ecosystem's artifact patterns only if that changes.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# == SECURITY: secrets & credentials ==
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
credentials.json
service-account.json
*.credentials
secrets/
.secrets/
*.secret

# == SECURITY: SSH / signing key material ==
id_rsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519

# == SECURITY: wallet / node key material ==
keystore/
*.keystore
wallet.json
mnemonic.txt

# == Local agent + working files (never shared) ==
# Exception: CLAUDE.md is committed at the repo root, not ignored here — it is a
# one-line `@AGENTS.md` import with no internal content. Operator decision, 2026-07-27.
.claude/
.local/
SESSION_NOTES.md
PLANNING.md
SCRATCH.md
*.scratch.*
*.draft.*

# == OS ==
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# == Editors / IDE ==
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# == Logs / temp ==
*.log
logs/
tmp/
*.tmp
*.pid

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Repo-specific ignores BELOW this line:
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
